          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None ga Tiro na Sidoni munyagiriza iki, mwe n’intara ziri kumwe namwe z’i Bufilisitiya? Mbega munyihora ico nabakoreye? Nimwaba muriko muranyihora, nzobasubizako vuba kandi vyihuta ivyo mwakoze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko mwafashe ifeza zanje n’inzahabu zanje, mugatwara ivyarusha ibindi kuba vyiza mu butunzi bwanje mubijana mu ngoro zanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwagurishije abantu banje b’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu ku Bagiriki, kugira ngo mubarungike kure y’igihugu cabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
